      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "QUICK START\n1. Choose a finished Krea2 / Turbo image in Load Image.\n2. Keep defaults for the first run, then press Run.\n3. PNG results go to output/ArtofTomworks/Upscale. The source file is preserved.\n\nNo prompt, sampler, VAE or diffusion re-generation. Works with images from other generators too.\nRequired upscale weights are separate downloads; none are bundled here.\nFast 2x: RealESRGAN_x2plus.pth. Detail 4x: 4x-UltraSharp.pth.\nThis workflow uses native ComfyUI nodes only."
      ],
      "color": "#354938",
      "bgcolor": "#1d2c24"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "Note",
      "title": "SIZE AND ASPECT",
      "pos": [
        820,
        390
      ],
      "size": [
        720,
        370
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 7,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "OUTPUT SIZE — NODE 4\nwidth=0, height=0 → native AI upscale size (default: 2x).\nExample: 1344 x 768 → 2688 x 1536.\n\nCustom width: width=3840, height=0.\nCustom height: width=0, height=2160.\nThe other dimension follows the aspect ratio automatically.\n\nBoth nonzero: exact output dimensions. A changed aspect ratio stretches with crop=disabled; crop=center crops instead.\nReducing the final size does not shorten the preceding AI upscale.\nLarger dimensions do not guarantee more genuine detail."
      ],
      "color": "#354938",
      "bgcolor": "#1d2c24"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "Note",
      "title": "SHARPNESS AND SPEED",
      "pos": [
        1610,
        610
      ],
      "size": [
        630,
        400
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 8,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "SHARPNESS — NODE 5\nalpha=0 → no extra sharpening.\nalpha=0.05–0.15 → restrained starting range.\nalpha=0.20 → stronger; inspect at 100% zoom.\nKeep sharpen_radius=1 and sigma=1 initially.\n\nReduce alpha if halos, crunchy skin or noise appear.\n\nSPEED\nStart with Fast_2x. The 4x AI model processes more output pixels.\nRuntime depends on source dimensions and available GPU memory. This package does not claim measured full-image speed.\nAI upscaling can change texture and cannot reliably repair anatomy or recover missing information."
      ],
      "color": "#354938",
      "bgcolor": "#1d2c24"
    }
